    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error 5xx (5m)",
      "id": 7,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "`or vector(0)` porque sum() sobre un vector vacio devuelve VACIO, no 0: sin eso el panel dice 'No data' cuando en realidad hay 0% de error, que es justo lo contrario. clamp_min evita el 0/0.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 3,
        "x": 9,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(kong_http_requests_total{code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(kong_http_requests_total[5m])) or vector(0), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "refId": "I",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p99 latencia (5m)",
      "id": 9,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Un guion o NaN significa que no hubo requests en la ventana: no hay latencia que reportar. A proposito NO se fuerza a 0 con `or vector(0)` como en los otros stats — un 0 ms ahi se leeria como 'responde instantaneo', que es lo contrario de la verdad.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 3,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(kong_request_latency_ms_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "refId": "K",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 500
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2000
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
